_Mohan\" title=\"Kim Mohan\">Kim Mohan</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Penny_Williams\" title=\"Penny Williams\">Penny Williams</a>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), pp. 61, 63, 88. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-4731-7\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-4731-7\">978-0-7869-4731-7</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRCS3e-p296-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-p296_3-0\">3.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-p296_3-1\">3.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-p296_3-2\">3.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-p296_3-3\">3.3</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sean_K._Reynolds\" title=\"Sean K. Reynolds\">Sean K. Reynolds</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Skip_Williams\" title=\"Skip Williams\">Skip Williams</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rob_Heinsoo\" title=\"Rob Heinsoo\">Rob Heinsoo</a>&#160;(June 2001). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Forgotten_Realms_Campaign_Setting_3rd_edition\" title=\"Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting 3rd edition\">Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting 3rd edition</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 296. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-1836-5\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-1836-5\">0-7869-1836-5</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-PftF-p101-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-PftF-p101_4-0\">4.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-PftF-p101_4-1\">4.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Doug_Stewart\" title=\"Doug Stewart\">Doug Stewart</a>&#160;(1997). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Prayers_from_the_Faithful\" title=\"Prayers from the Faithful\">Prayers from the Faithful</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" ti